  },
  "domain": "Compliance",
  "description": "Jurisdiction-neutral workflows for data-subject rights (access, rectification, erasure, grievance, nomination), personal data breach handling and cyber-incident reporting. Rights, time limits, authorities and report items come from the tenant's jurisdiction pack (first pack: IN). Adds accounting of disclosures, restriction, objection, automated-decision review and the threshold-driven breach notification plan (US-HIPAA, EU-GDPR).",
